sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Customer
    actor Admin
    participant CustomerUI as Customer UI
    participant AdminUI as Admin UI
    participant Middleware as Next.js Middleware
    participant AuthAPI as Auth API
    participant StoreAPI as Storefront API
    participant OrdersAPI as Orders API
    participant SupportAPI as Support API
    participant AdminAPI as Admin API
    participant UploadAPI as Upload API
    participant Firebase as Firebase Auth
    participant Pusher as Pusher
    participant SSE as orderEvents / SSE
    participant Mail as SMTP / Sendinblue
    participant Storage as Image Storage
    participant Prisma as Prisma ORM
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over CustomerUI,AdminAPI: Sensitive pages and APIs pass through middleware security headers. Mutating routes also use JWT auth, origin checks, rate limits, and upload guards where applicable.

    rect rgb(247, 247, 247)
        Note over Customer,CustomerUI: 1. Session bootstrap and authentication
        Customer->>CustomerUI: Open site or auth page
        CustomerUI->>Middleware: Request page or API
        Middleware-->>CustomerUI: Continue with security headers
        CustomerUI->>AuthAPI: GET /api/auth/me
        AuthAPI->>Prisma: getAuthenticatedUser()
        Prisma->>DB: SELECT user by JWT subject
        DB-->>Prisma: user, default address, order summary
        Prisma-->>AuthAPI: user
        alt Access token missing or expired
            AuthAPI-->>CustomerUI: 401 Unauthorized
            CustomerUI->>AuthAPI: POST /api/auth/refresh
            AuthAPI->>Prisma: rotateRefreshSession()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT hashed session
            DB-->>Prisma: current session and user
            Prisma->>DB: DELETE old session and INSERT new session
            DB-->>Prisma: rotated session
            AuthAPI-->>CustomerUI: Set fresh access and refresh cookies
            CustomerUI->>AuthAPI: Retry GET /api/auth/me
            AuthAPI->>Prisma: getAuthenticatedUser()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT user
            DB-->>Prisma: user
            Prisma-->>AuthAPI: user
        else Session already valid
            AuthAPI-->>CustomerUI: user profile
        end

        alt Email/password signup
            Customer->>CustomerUI: Submit signup form
            CustomerUI->>AuthAPI: POST /api/auth/signup
            AuthAPI->>Prisma: Validate email uniqueness and create user
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT user
            DB-->>Prisma: created user
            AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: Hash password and sign access JWT
            AuthAPI->>Prisma: createRefreshSession()
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT session
            DB-->>Prisma: refresh session
            AuthAPI-->>CustomerUI: Set auth cookies and return user
        else Email/password login
            Customer->>CustomerUI: Submit login form
            CustomerUI->>AuthAPI: POST /api/auth/login
            AuthAPI->>Prisma: Load user and password hash
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT user
            DB-->>Prisma: user
            AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
            AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: sign access JWT
            AuthAPI->>Prisma: createRefreshSession()
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT session
            DB-->>Prisma: refresh session
            AuthAPI-->>CustomerUI: Set auth cookies and return user
        else Google or Firebase login
            Customer->>Firebase: Popup or redirect sign-in
            Firebase-->>CustomerUI: Firebase ID token
            CustomerUI->>AuthAPI: POST /api/auth/firebase-login or /api/auth/google-login
            AuthAPI->>Firebase: verifyIdToken()
            Firebase-->>AuthAPI: verified identity
            AuthAPI->>Prisma: Find or create user
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT or INSERT user
            DB-->>Prisma: user
            AuthAPI->>AuthAPI: sign access JWT
            AuthAPI->>Prisma: createRefreshSession()
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT session
            DB-->>Prisma: refresh session
            AuthAPI-->>CustomerUI: Set auth cookies and return user
        end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 250, 255)
        Note over Customer,CustomerUI: 2. Storefront discovery and client state hydration
        par Load catalog data
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: GET /api/categories
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: category.findMany()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT categories
            DB-->>Prisma: categories
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: categories
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: categories
        and Search and filter products
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: GET /api/products with filters
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: product.findMany() and review aggregates
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT products and grouped review stats
            DB-->>Prisma: products and ratings
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: filtered products
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: product list
        and Open a product
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: GET /api/products/[id or slug]
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: product.findUnique()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT product and category
            DB-->>Prisma: product
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: product
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: product detail
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: GET /api/products/[id]/review
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: aggregate reviews and latest reviews
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT review stats and reviews
            DB-->>Prisma: review data
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: ratings and reviews
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: review summary
        and Hydrate authenticated state
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: GET /api/cart
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: cartItem.findMany()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT cart items and products
            DB-->>Prisma: cart items
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: cart items
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: cart state
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: GET /api/wishlist
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: wishlistItem.findMany()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT wishlist items and products
            DB-->>Prisma: wishlist items
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: wishlist items
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: wishlist state
        end
    end

    rect rgb(248, 255, 248)
        Note over Customer,CustomerUI: 3. Cart, wishlist, and address book mutations
        alt Add or update cart
            Customer->>CustomerUI: Add item or change quantity
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: POST /api/cart or PUT /api/cart/[id]
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: Load product and existing cart item
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT product and cartItem
            DB-->>Prisma: product and cartItem
            alt Stock available
                StoreAPI->>Prisma: CREATE or UPDATE cartItem
                Prisma->>DB: INSERT or UPDATE cartItem
                DB-->>Prisma: saved cart item
                Prisma-->>StoreAPI: cart item
                StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: updated cart item
            else Stock unavailable
                StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: 400 stock validation error
            end
        else Remove cart item
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: DELETE /api/cart/[id]
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: delete cartItem
            Prisma->>DB: DELETE cartItem
            DB-->>Prisma: success
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: success
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: success
        else Add or remove wishlist item
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: POST /api/wishlist or DELETE /api/wishlist/[productId]
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: create or delete wishlistItem
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT or DELETE wishlistItem
            DB-->>Prisma: success
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: wishlist result
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: updated wishlist state
        else Manage addresses
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: GET /api/addresses
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: address.findMany()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT addresses
            DB-->>Prisma: addresses
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: addresses
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: address book
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: POST, PATCH, or DELETE /api/addresses...
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: create, update, or delete address
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT, UPDATE, or DELETE address
            DB-->>Prisma: address result
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: address result
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: updated address book
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 250, 245)
        Note over Customer,CustomerUI: 4. Checkout and order creation
        Customer->>CustomerUI: Open checkout
        CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: GET /api/addresses
        StoreAPI->>Prisma: address.findMany(userId)
        Prisma->>DB: SELECT addresses
        DB-->>Prisma: addresses
        Prisma-->>StoreAPI: addresses
        StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: addresses

        opt Apply coupon
            Customer->>CustomerUI: Enter coupon code
            CustomerUI->>OrdersAPI: POST /api/coupons/validate
            OrdersAPI->>Prisma: coupon.findUnique(code)
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT coupon
            DB-->>Prisma: coupon
            Prisma-->>OrdersAPI: coupon
            OrdersAPI-->>CustomerUI: coupon type and amount
        end

        Customer->>CustomerUI: Submit order
        CustomerUI->>OrdersAPI: POST /api/orders
        OrdersAPI->>Prisma: Load shipping address, billing address, and cart items
        Prisma->>DB: SELECT addresses, cart items, and products
        DB-->>Prisma: addresses and cart snapshot
        Prisma-->>OrdersAPI: checkout inputs
        Note right of OrdersAPI: paymentMethod is recorded locally<br/>paymentStatus starts as unpaid<br/>No external payment gateway is called here
        OrdersAPI->>Prisma: prisma.$transaction(...)
        Prisma->>DB: UPDATE coupon usedCount if present
        Prisma->>DB: UPDATE each product stockQuantity
        Prisma->>DB: INSERT order and orderItems
        Prisma->>DB: DELETE all user cartItems
        DB-->>Prisma: created order and stock snapshot
        Prisma-->>OrdersAPI: created order

        par Notify admin dashboard
            OrdersAPI->>Pusher: trigger private-admin-channel:new-order
            Pusher-->>AdminUI: new-order notification
        and Send admin email
            OrdersAPI->>Mail: sendOrderNotificationEmail()
            Mail-->>Admin: new order email
        and Send customer confirmation
            OrdersAPI->>Mail: send order confirmation email
            Mail-->>Customer: order confirmation email
        end

        opt Stock crossed alert threshold
            OrdersAPI->>Mail: send low-stock or out-of-stock email
            OrdersAPI->>Pusher: trigger low-stock or out-of-stock
            Pusher-->>AdminUI: stock alert notification
            Mail-->>Admin: stock alert email
        end

        OrdersAPI-->>CustomerUI: created order
        CustomerUI->>CustomerUI: clear cart and save lastOrderNumber
        CustomerUI-->>Customer: Redirect to /checkout/success
    end

    rect rgb(245, 255, 255)
        Note over Admin,AdminUI: 5. Admin orders, analytics, exports, and customer order lifecycle
        Admin->>AdminUI: Open orders dashboard
        AdminUI->>OrdersAPI: GET /api/orders
        OrdersAPI->>Prisma: order.findMany()
        Prisma->>DB: SELECT orders, orderItems, and users
        DB-->>Prisma: orders
        Prisma-->>OrdersAPI: orders
        OrdersAPI-->>AdminUI: orders list

        AdminUI->>AdminAPI: GET /api/admin/metrics?period=...
        AdminAPI->>Prisma: count, group, and aggregate orders
        Prisma->>DB: SELECT metrics aggregates
        DB-->>Prisma: metrics
        Prisma-->>AdminAPI: metrics
        AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: charts and totals

        AdminUI->>OrdersAPI: POST /api/orders/pusher-auth
        OrdersAPI->>Pusher: authorize private-admin-channel
        Pusher-->>AdminUI: admin realtime subscription auth

        AdminUI->>OrdersAPI: GET /api/orders/stream
        OrdersAPI->>SSE: Register admin listener
        SSE-->>AdminUI: Keep SSE connection open

        Admin->>AdminUI: Change order status
        AdminUI->>OrdersAPI: PATCH /api/orders/[id]/status
        OrdersAPI->>Prisma: order.update(status)
        Prisma->>DB: UPDATE order and SELECT order.user
        DB-->>Prisma: updated order
        Prisma-->>OrdersAPI: updated order

        par Notify customer
            OrdersAPI->>Mail: send status change email
            Mail-->>Customer: accepted, shipped, or delivered email
        and Update live admin dashboards
            OrdersAPI->>SSE: emit updated order event
            SSE-->>AdminUI: onmessage(order updated)
        end

        opt Customer views order history or detail
            CustomerUI->>OrdersAPI: GET /api/orders or /api/orders/[id]
            OrdersAPI->>Prisma: order.findMany() or order.findFirst()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT order data
            DB-->>Prisma: order data
            Prisma-->>OrdersAPI: order data
            OrdersAPI-->>CustomerUI: order history or detail
        end

        opt Customer reviews delivered product
            Customer->>CustomerUI: Submit product review
            CustomerUI->>StoreAPI: POST /api/products/[id]/review
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: verify delivered orderItem exists
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT eligible orderItem
            DB-->>Prisma: eligibility result
            StoreAPI->>Prisma: upsert productReview
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT or UPDATE review
            DB-->>Prisma: saved review
            Prisma-->>StoreAPI: review
            StoreAPI-->>CustomerUI: review saved
        end

        opt Admin exports orders
            AdminUI->>OrdersAPI: GET /api/orders/export
            OrdersAPI->>Prisma: order.findMany()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT orders and users
            DB-->>Prisma: export data
            Prisma-->>OrdersAPI: CSV rows
            OrdersAPI-->>AdminUI: orders.csv download
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 245, 250)
        Note over Customer,Admin: 6. Support ticket lifecycle with live customer and admin chat
        Customer->>CustomerUI: Create support ticket with optional image attachments
        loop Each attachment
            CustomerUI->>SupportAPI: POST /api/support/attachments
            SupportAPI->>UploadAPI: guardUploadRequest() and validateUploadBuffer()
            UploadAPI->>Storage: storeSupportAttachment()
            Storage-->>UploadAPI: signed attachment URL and metadata
            UploadAPI-->>SupportAPI: attachment payload
            SupportAPI-->>CustomerUI: attachment payload
        end

        CustomerUI->>SupportAPI: POST /api/support/ticket
        SupportAPI->>Prisma: create supportTicket
        Prisma->>DB: INSERT supportTicket
        DB-->>Prisma: ticket
        opt First message only contains attachments
            SupportAPI->>Prisma: create supportMessage(sender=customer)
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT supportMessage
            DB-->>Prisma: message
        end
        SupportAPI->>Mail: Sendinblue acknowledgement email
        Mail-->>Customer: ticket received email
        SupportAPI-->>CustomerUI: ticket id
        CustomerUI-->>Customer: Redirect to /support/ticket/[id]

        opt Admin opens support inbox
            AdminUI->>AdminAPI: GET /api/admin/support/ticket
            AdminAPI->>Prisma: supportTicket.findMany()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT support tickets
            DB-->>Prisma: tickets
            Prisma-->>AdminAPI: tickets
            AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: support queue
        end

        CustomerUI->>SupportAPI: GET /api/support/ticket/[id]
        SupportAPI->>Prisma: supportTicket.findUnique(include messages)
        Prisma->>DB: SELECT ticket and ordered messages
        DB-->>Prisma: ticket thread
        Prisma-->>SupportAPI: ticket thread
        SupportAPI-->>CustomerUI: initial thread state

        Admin->>AdminUI: Open support ticket detail
        AdminUI->>SupportAPI: GET /api/support/ticket/[id]
        SupportAPI->>Prisma: supportTicket.findUnique(include messages)
        Prisma->>DB: SELECT ticket and ordered messages
        DB-->>Prisma: ticket thread
        Prisma-->>SupportAPI: ticket thread
        SupportAPI-->>AdminUI: initial thread state

        par Customer subscribes to live thread
            CustomerUI->>SupportAPI: POST /api/support/pusher-auth
            SupportAPI->>Prisma: verify ticket ownership
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT ticket and user email
            DB-->>Prisma: authorization data
            SupportAPI->>Pusher: authorize private-support-ticket-{id}
            Pusher-->>CustomerUI: subscription auth
        and Admin subscribes to live thread
            AdminUI->>SupportAPI: POST /api/support/pusher-auth
            SupportAPI->>Prisma: verify admin access
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT ticket
            DB-->>Prisma: authorization data
            SupportAPI->>Pusher: authorize private-support-ticket-{id}
            Pusher-->>AdminUI: subscription auth
        end

        opt Typing indicators
            CustomerUI->>Pusher: client-typing from customer
            Pusher-->>AdminUI: client-typing
            AdminUI->>Pusher: client-typing from agent
            Pusher-->>CustomerUI: client-typing
        end

        alt Customer sends follow-up message
            CustomerUI->>SupportAPI: POST /api/support/ticket/[id]
            SupportAPI->>Prisma: create supportMessage(sender=customer)
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT supportMessage
            DB-->>Prisma: message
            SupportAPI->>Pusher: trigger new-message
            Pusher-->>AdminUI: new-message
            Pusher-->>CustomerUI: new-message
        else Admin replies and changes status
            AdminUI->>SupportAPI: POST /api/admin/support/ticket/[id]/reply
            SupportAPI->>Prisma: create supportMessage(sender=agent)
            Prisma->>DB: INSERT supportMessage
            DB-->>Prisma: message
            SupportAPI->>Prisma: update supportTicket.status
            Prisma->>DB: UPDATE supportTicket
            DB-->>Prisma: updated ticket
            par Live chat update
                SupportAPI->>Pusher: trigger new-message
                Pusher-->>CustomerUI: new-message
                Pusher-->>AdminUI: new-message
            and Live status update
                SupportAPI->>Pusher: trigger status-changed
                Pusher-->>CustomerUI: status-changed
                Pusher-->>AdminUI: status-changed
            and Customer email
                SupportAPI->>Mail: Sendinblue reply email
                Mail-->>Customer: support reply email
            end
        end
    end

    rect rgb(245, 245, 255)
        Note over Admin,AdminUI: 7. Admin catalog, coupon, user, review, and upload management
        opt Upload product media
            loop Each product image
                AdminUI->>UploadAPI: POST /api/uploads/imagekit?folder=products
                UploadAPI->>UploadAPI: guardUploadRequest(requireAdmin)
                UploadAPI->>UploadAPI: optimizeImageIfNeeded()
                UploadAPI->>Storage: Upload to ImageKit
                Storage-->>UploadAPI: asset URL and metadata
                UploadAPI-->>AdminUI: uploaded asset payload
            end
        end

        par Product CRUD
            AdminUI->>AdminAPI: GET, POST, PATCH, or DELETE /api/admin/products...
            AdminAPI->>Prisma: query or mutate Product
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, or DELETE product
            DB-->>Prisma: product result
            Prisma-->>AdminAPI: product response
            AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: refreshed product state
        and Coupon CRUD
            AdminUI->>AdminAPI: GET, POST, PATCH, or DELETE /api/admin/coupons
            AdminAPI->>Prisma: query or mutate Coupon
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT, INSERT, UPDATE, or DELETE coupon
            DB-->>Prisma: coupon result
            Prisma-->>AdminAPI: coupon response
            AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: refreshed coupon state
        and User administration
            AdminUI->>AdminAPI: GET or PATCH /api/admin/users
            AdminAPI->>Prisma: list users or update role
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT or UPDATE user
            DB-->>Prisma: user data
            Prisma-->>AdminAPI: user response
            AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: refreshed user state
        and Review moderation
            AdminUI->>AdminAPI: GET /api/admin/reviews
            AdminAPI->>Prisma: review.findMany()
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT reviews, product, and user
            DB-->>Prisma: reviews
            Prisma-->>AdminAPI: reviews
            AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: review queue
            AdminUI->>AdminAPI: PATCH /api/admin/reviews/[id]/reply
            AdminAPI->>Prisma: update adminReply and adminReaction
            Prisma->>DB: UPDATE productReview
            DB-->>Prisma: updated review
            Prisma-->>AdminAPI: review response
            AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: updated moderation state
        end

        opt Send abandoned cart reminder
            AdminUI->>AdminAPI: POST /api/admin/users/[id]/remind-cart
            AdminAPI->>Prisma: find stale cart items and target user
            Prisma->>DB: SELECT cartItems and user
            DB-->>Prisma: items and user
            AdminAPI->>Mail: send reminder email
            Mail-->>Customer: return-to-cart email
            AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: success
        end

        opt Delete user account
            AdminUI->>AdminAPI: DELETE /api/admin/users/[id]
            AdminAPI->>Prisma: delete cart, wishlist, addresses, orders, notes, and user
            Prisma->>DB: DELETE dependent records and user
            DB-->>Prisma: delete result
            AdminAPI->>Mail: send account deletion email
            Mail-->>Customer: account deleted email
            AdminAPI-->>AdminUI: success
        end
    end
